      <div>
        <p class="ln-kicker">{% if is_fr %}O&ugrave; la recherche a regard&eacute;{% else %}Where the research looked{% endif %}</p>
        <h2 class="ln-title ln-title--wide">
          {%- if is_fr -%}Le corps, zone par zone.{%- else -%}The body, area by area.{%- endif -%}
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="ln-head__aside">
        <p>
          {%- if is_fr -%}
            Les zones absentes de ce sch&eacute;ma le sont parce que nous n'avons pas de publication
            &agrave; y rattacher, pas parce que la lumi&egrave;re s'y arr&ecirc;te.
          {%- else -%}
            Areas missing from this diagram are missing because we have no paper to attach to them, not
            because light stops there.
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
        <a class="ln-link" href="{{ science_url }}">
