{%- comment -%}
  Fiches par zone. Le badge de niveau de preuve n'est pas decoratif : c'est ce
  qui distingue une meta-analyse sur 820 patients d'un essai sur vingt
  athletes, et le lecteur doit pouvoir en tenir compte.
{%- endcomment -%}
<section class="ln-section">
  <div class="ln-shell">
    <div class="ln-head ln-reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="ln-kicker">{% if is_fr %}Neuf r&eacute;sultats{% else %}Nine results{% endif %}</p>
        <h2 class="ln-title ln-title--wide">
          {%- if is_fr -%}Ce qui a &eacute;t&eacute; mesur&eacute;, et &agrave; quel niveau de preuve.{%- else -%}What was measured, and at what level of evidence.{%- endif -%}
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="ln-head__aside">
        <p>
          {%- if is_fr -%}
            Une m&eacute;ta-analyse agr&egrave;ge plusieurs essais randomis&eacute;s : c'est le niveau le
            plus solide cit&eacute; ici. Un essai isol&eacute; sur vingt personnes est un signal, pas une
            preuve &mdash; et c'est &eacute;crit &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; du r&eacute;sultat.
          {%- else -%}
            A meta-analysis pools several randomised trials: the strongest level cited here. A single trial
            on twenty people is a signal, not a proof &mdash; and it says so next to the result.
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ln-evidence">
      <article class="ln-study ln-reveal">
        <span class="ln-study__tag">01 &middot; {% if is_fr %}Cheveux{% else %}Hair{% endif %}</span>
        <span class="ln-grade ln-grade--rct">{% if is_fr %}Essai randomis&eacute;{% else %}Randomised trial{% endif %}</span>
        <h3 class="ln-study__claim">{% if is_fr %}+37 % de cheveux compt&eacute;s{% else %}+37 % counted hairs{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-study__detail">
          {% if is_fr %}42 femmes, 655 nm, 16 semaines, une s&eacute;ance un jour sur deux. Comptage photographique sur zone tatou&eacute;e, lu en aveugle. Aucun effet ind&eacute;sirable rapport&eacute;.{% else %}42 women, 655 nm, 16 weeks, one session every other day. Photographic count on a tattooed area, scored blind. No adverse events reported.{% endif %}
        </p>
        <p class="ln-study__ref">Lanzafame RJ et al. <cite>Lasers Surg Med</cite> 2014;46(8):601&ndash;607. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1002/lsm.22277" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI</a></p>
      </article>

      <article class="ln-study ln-reveal">
        <span class="ln-study__tag">02 &middot; {% if is_fr %}Vision{% else %}Vision{% endif %}</span>
        <span class="ln-grade ln-grade--rct">{% if is_fr %}Essai randomis&eacute;{% else %}Randomised trial{% endif %}</span>
        <h3 class="ln-study__claim">{% if is_fr %}Acuit&eacute; visuelle am&eacute;lior&eacute;e en DMLA s&egrave;che{% else %}Visual acuity improved in dry AMD{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-study__detail">
          {% if is_fr %}100 sujets, 590, 660 et 850 nm contre placebo, sur 13 mois. &Agrave; noter : l'essai portait sur un dispositif m&eacute;dical encadr&eacute;, pas sur un appareil domestique.{% else %}100 subjects, 590, 660 and 850 nm against sham, over 13 months. Note: the trial used a regulated medical device, not a home appliance.{% endif %}
        </p>
        <p class="ln-study__ref">Boyer D et al. <cite>Retina</cite> 2024;44(3):487&ndash;497. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1097/IAE.0000000000003980" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI</a></p>
      </article>

      <article class="ln-study ln-reveal">
        <span class="ln-study__tag">03 &middot; {% if is_fr %}Peau{% else %}Skin{% endif %}</span>
        <span class="ln-grade ln-grade--rct">{% if is_fr %}Essai randomis&eacute;{% else %}Randomised trial{% endif %}</span>
        <h3 class="ln-study__claim">{% if is_fr %}Rugosit&eacute; en baisse, collag&egrave;ne en hausse{% else %}Roughness down, collagen up{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-study__detail">
          {% if is_fr %}136 volontaires, 30 s&eacute;ances. Densit&eacute; de collag&egrave;ne en &eacute;chographie, rugosit&eacute; en profilom&eacute;trie, photos &eacute;valu&eacute;es en aveugle : les trois mesures s'am&eacute;liorent.{% else %}136 volunteers, 30 sessions. Collagen density by ultrasound, roughness by profilometry, photographs scored blind: all three measures improve.{% endif %}
        </p>
        <p class="ln-study__ref">Wunsch A, Matuschka K. <cite>Photomed Laser Surg</cite> 2014;32(2):93&ndash;100. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1089/pho.2013.3616" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI</a></p>
      </article>

      <article class="ln-study ln-reveal">
        <span class="ln-study__tag">04 &middot; {% if is_fr %}Douleur{% else %}Pain{% endif %}</span>
        <span class="ln-grade ln-grade--meta">{% if is_fr %}M&eacute;ta-analyse{% else %}Meta-analysis{% endif %}</span>
        <h3 class="ln-study__claim">{% if is_fr %}20 mm de douleur en moins, jusqu'&agrave; 22 semaines{% else %}20 mm less pain, up to 22 weeks{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-study__detail">
          {% if is_fr %}16 essais randomis&eacute;s, 820 patients souffrant de cervicalgies. Effets ind&eacute;sirables non diff&eacute;rents du placebo. La plus large preuve cit&eacute;e sur ce site.{% else %}16 randomised trials, 820 patients with neck pain. Side effects no different from placebo. The largest body of evidence cited on this site.{% endif %}
        </p>
        <p class="ln-study__ref">Chow RT et al. <cite>The Lancet</cite> 2009;374(9705):1897&ndash;1908. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/S0140-6736(09)61522-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI</a></p>
      </article>

      <article class="ln-study ln-reveal">
        <span class="ln-study__tag">05 &middot; {% if is_fr %}Sommeil{% else %}Sleep{% endif %}</span>
        <span class="ln-grade ln-grade--signal">{% if is_fr %}Petit &eacute;chantillon{% else %}Small sample{% endif %}</span>
        <h3 class="ln-study__claim">{% if is_fr %}Score de sommeil et m&eacute;latonine en hausse{% else %}Sleep score and melatonin both up{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-study__detail">
          {% if is_fr %}20 athl&egrave;tes, 14 jours, 30 minutes par soir. &Eacute;chantillon petit : &agrave; consid&eacute;rer comme un signal, pas comme une preuve d&eacute;finitive.{% else %}20 athletes, 14 days, 30 minutes each evening. Small sample: treat it as a signal, not as definitive proof.{% endif %}
        </p>
        <p class="ln-study__ref">Zhao J et al. <cite>J Athl Train</cite> 2012;47(6):673&ndash;678. <a href="https://doi.org/10.4085/1062-6050-47.6.08" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI</a></p>
      </article>

      <article class="ln-study ln-reveal">
        <span class="ln-study__tag">06 &middot; Performance</span>
        <span class="ln-grade ln-grade--meta">{% if is_fr %}M&eacute;ta-analyse{% else %}Meta-analysis{% endif %}</span>
        <h3 class="ln-study__claim">{% if is_fr %}Plus de r&eacute;p&eacute;titions, si la lumi&egrave;re pr&eacute;c&egrave;de l'effort{% else %}More repetitions, if the light comes first{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-study__detail">
          {% if is_fr %}13 essais randomis&eacute;s. Gain moyen de 5,5 r&eacute;p&eacute;titions et 4,1 secondes avant &eacute;puisement, obtenu surtout en application <em>avant</em> l'exercice.{% else %}13 randomised trials. Mean gain of 5.5 repetitions and 4.1 seconds to exhaustion, obtained mainly by applying light <em>before</em> exercise.{% endif %}
        </p>
        <p class="ln-study__ref">Leal-Junior ECP et al. <cite>Lasers Med Sci</cite> 2015;30(2):925&ndash;939. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/s10103-013-1465-4" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI</a></p>
      </article>

      <article class="ln-study ln-reveal">
        <span class="ln-study__tag">07 &middot; {% if is_fr %}R&eacute;cup&eacute;ration{% else %}Recovery{% endif %}</span>
        <span class="ln-grade ln-grade--meta">{% if is_fr %}M&eacute;ta-analyse{% else %}Meta-analysis{% endif %}</span>
        <h3 class="ln-study__claim">{% if is_fr %}Cr&eacute;atine kinase mieux contenue apr&egrave;s l'effort{% else %}Creatine kinase better contained after exercise{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-study__detail">
          {% if is_fr %}14 &eacute;tudes sur le marqueur sanguin de dommage musculaire. Effet net sur l'exercice localis&eacute;, <strong>non concluant sur l'exercice g&eacute;n&eacute;ral</strong> &mdash; une nuance que la plupart des pages produit passent sous silence.{% else %}14 studies on the blood marker of muscle damage. Clear effect for localised exercise, <strong>inconclusive for general exercise</strong> &mdash; a nuance most product pages leave out.{% endif %}
        </p>
        <p class="ln-study__ref">Machado AF et al. <cite>Clin J Sport Med</cite> 2020;30(3):267&ndash;274. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1097/JSM.0000000000000606" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI</a></p>
      </article>

      <article class="ln-study ln-reveal">
        <span class="ln-study__tag">08 &middot; {% if is_fr %}Articulations{% else %}Joints{% endif %}</span>
        <span class="ln-grade ln-grade--meta">{% if is_fr %}M&eacute;ta-analyse{% else %}Meta-analysis{% endif %}</span>
        <h3 class="ln-study__claim">{% if is_fr %}Meilleur que l'exercice seul, en compl&eacute;ment{% else %}Better than exercise alone, as an adjunct{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-study__detail">
          {% if is_fr %}10 essais randomis&eacute;s sur l'arthrose du genou, tous de bon score PEDro. Le mot important est <em>en compl&eacute;ment</em> : la lumi&egrave;re s'ajoute au mouvement, elle ne le remplace pas.{% else %}10 randomised trials on knee osteoarthritis, all with good PEDro scores. The important words are <em>as an adjunct</em>: light adds to movement, it does not replace it.{% endif %}
        </p>
        <p class="ln-study__ref">Ahmad MA et al. <cite>Physiotherapy</cite> 2021;114:85&ndash;95. <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.physio.2021.03.011" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI</a></p>
      </article>

      <article class="ln-study ln-reveal">
        <span class="ln-study__tag">09 &middot; {% if is_fr %}M&eacute;canisme{% else %}Mechanism{% endif %}</span>
        <span class="ln-grade ln-grade--mech">{% if is_fr %}Revue de m&eacute;canisme{% else %}Mechanism review{% endif %}</span>
        <h3 class="ln-study__claim">{% if is_fr %}Le photon, le monoxyde d'azote et l'ATP{% else %}The photon, nitric oxide and ATP{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-study__detail">
